<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <title>About — PrepSpar</title>
  <%- include('partials/head') %>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/static/css/content.css" />
</head>
<body>
  <div class="page-shell">
    <%- include('partials/navbar', { active: 'about', user }) %>

    <main class="content-wrap">
      <div class="page-header">
        <div class="eyebrow">About Us</div>
        <h1>Helping candidates walk into interviews <span class="gradient-text">prepared, not anxious.</span></h1>
      </div>

      <section class="section prose">
        <p>PrepSpar started as a simple idea: interview prep shouldn't rely on a generic list of questions you've already memorized the answers to. Real interviews adapt to <em>you</em> — your resume, your skills, your experience — and your practice should too.</p>
        <p>We built an AI interviewer that reads your resume, asks you questions actually relevant to your background, listens to how you answer, and steps in with a hint if you go quiet for too long — the same way a thoughtful human interviewer would.</p>

        <h2 style="margin-top:48px;">Meet the Founder</h2>
        <div class="founder-card">
          <img class="founder-photo" src="/static/prerana-jadhav.jpg" alt="Prerana Jadhav" />
          <h4>Prerana Jadhav</h4>
          <span>Founder & Engineer</span>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>

    <%- include('partials/footer') %>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
